    <string name="help_watchlist_title">Watchlist page: gain since added</string>
    <string name="help_watchlist_body">Tapping ★ Watchlist shows every starred stock: the price it was added at, how many % up or down since, and at the top the whole watchlist\'s average return, a line of the last 20 days and how many stocks gain or lose. Each stock has a bar: while it waits for a breakout, from the base\'s low (support) to the breakout price, and after the breakout from the SL to the next target; the dot shows where the price is now. Its alert is written below. Stocks added before this update count from their price in the first scan; long-press a stock to enter your own buy price. Swipe left to remove, ↻ refreshes prices at once, ☰ shows the same stocks in the home list.</string>
